<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115825" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῠγμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a
				means of cooling, anything that cools</i>: hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a cooling lotion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.16
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>a cooling medicine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aff.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fan,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Clearch.
				25
			</span></i> (cj. Casaubon: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῆγμα</span> codd.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i>, Kaibel). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>breath drawn, inhalation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
			<i>cold, chilling behaviour,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				1.24.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>chink, fissure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				10.7
			</span></i> codd.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
